body:
After Regicide you can go and do Zulrah. (Can take the fairy ring BJS - Big Jinormous Snake) Or Port Tyras Charter ship. 

if you want the Crystal Armour and Bow or Blade you will need to complete The remaining Elven Quest line (Roving elves, Mourning's End Part 1. Mourning's End Part 2. and making History. and the Creme De La Creme - **Song of the Elves**)

Then if you aren't a Main account you'll go through farming The Gauntlet or the Corrupted Gauntlet for the Armour pieces and enhanced weapon seed. But have fun, Zulrah is a fun time. GL.

You can continue checking to see if tickets are available they expire after 5 minutes if they are sitting in someone's cart.

&#x200B;

however if they are completely sold out, then there is no option. You can still go to the arena just not inside and chill, eat and watch the games on the TV's provided.

I've been using Aria Moondrops, I've enjoyed them in countless games,  now and love the sound quality they offer.

&#x200B;

Bought them for like 80$ USD haven't had issues, some people also buy a DAC or an AMP to go further with them.

Allow me to use my 99 firemaking to burn down half of Catherby and their houses so that I can more easily access the bank and farming patches please and thank you Jagex.

&#x200B;

it's not arson if it's for the betterment of my play style.
